### 🔑 Login para obtener token (usar auth-service primero)
POST {{baseUrlAuth}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email":     "{{email}}",
  "password":  "{{pwd}}"
}

### 👤 Crear perfil de usuario
POST {{baseUrlProfile}}/profiles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Dr. Alejandro",
  "lastName": "Sánchez",
  "dateOfBirth": "1985-03-15",
  "gender": "male",
  "phone": "+1234567890",
  "address": "Calle Principal 123",
  "city": "Ciudad de México",
  "state": "CDMX",
  "country": "México",
  "postalCode": "12345",
  "bio": "Médico pediatra con 10 años de experiencia en atención infantil",
  "specialty": "Pediatra"
}

### 👤 Obtener mi perfil
GET {{baseUrlProfile}}/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 👤 Obtener perfil por ID
GET {{baseUrlProfile}}/profiles/{{profileId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 👤 Actualizar mi perfil
PUT {{baseUrlProfile}}/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Dr. Alejandro Carlos",
  "lastName": "Sánchez García",
  "phone": "+1234567891",
  "bio": "Médico pediatra especializado en neonatología con 12 años de experiencia",
  "specialty": "Pediatra"
}

### 👤 Actualizar perfil por ID (admin)
PUT {{baseUrlProfile}}/profiles/{{profileId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Dr. Alejandro",
  "lastName": "Sánchez",
  "phone": "+1234567892",
  "bio": "Médico pediatra con experiencia en atención integral del niño",
  "specialty": "Pediatra"
}

### 📸 Subir foto de perfil
POST {{baseUrlProfile}}/profiles/upload-picture
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
