### 📋 Listar todos los perfiles
GET {{baseUrlProfile}}/profiles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📋 Listar perfiles con paginación
GET {{baseUrlProfile}}/profiles?page=1&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 🔍 Buscar perfiles por nombre
GET {{baseUrlProfile}}/profiles/search?q=Alejandro
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 🔍 Buscar perfiles con paginación
GET {{baseUrlProfile}}/profiles/search?q=Sánchez&page=1&limit=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 🗑️ Eliminar mi perfil (soft delete)
DELETE {{baseUrlProfile}}/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 🗑️ Eliminar perfil por ID (admin)
DELETE {{baseUrlProfile}}/profiles/{{profileId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 💚 Verificar salud del servicio
GET {{baseUrlProfile}}/health

